abstract: >-
  A bilingual (English/Russian) research survey and catalogue of the dynamics of
  interacting LLM agents: scaling and economics, self-organization, memory, safety,
  echo and model diversity, collective beliefs and swarms in the wild. Corpus cut-off
  3 October 2026. Human-AI collaboration: Ouroboros is an AI agent system.
